-  ; arg 7 (R11 in x86)
-  ; arg 6 (R10 in x86)
-  ; arg 5 (R8 in x86)
-  ; arg 4 (R8 in x86)
-  ; arg 3 (RCX in x86)
-  ; arg 2 (RDX in x86)
-  ; arg 1 (RSI in x86)
-  ; arg 0 (RDI in x86)
