 ;; Call c++ code through mips2c.
 ;; GOAL will call a dynamically generated trampoline.
 ;; The trampoline will have pushed the exec function and stack offset onto the stack
+;; Ottsel S2.1: this replaces the (never-wired, half-ported) upstream ARM64
+;; version with the no-emit stub contract: the stub pushes [stack_size] then
+;; [exec] (16 bytes each, ARM64 stack alignment) and branches here.  GOAL
